    ["<Assistant_Title1>гЂђFamily-Reward ExplanationгЂ‘</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Family Attribute Bonuses: </>Teaming up with a certain number of Family members in a dungeon grants extra <Assistant_Property1>Resurrection count bonuses</> and <Assistant_Property1>attribute supplementation bonuses</>. There is a <Assistant_Red>24-hour</> cooldown period after leaving a Family.\n<Assistant_Title2> Dungeon Reward Bonuses: </>Clearing specific dungeons while teamed up with a certain number of Family members grants <Assistant_Property1>extra rewards</>. There is a <Assistant_Red>24-hour</> cooldown period after leaving a Family.\n<Assistant_Title2> Family Shop Rewards: </>Completing Family quests grants <Assistant_Property1>Rapport</> and <Assistant_Property1>Companion Emblem</> rewards. Upon meeting certain Family level and membership duration requirements, you can exchange them for <Assistant_System>precious rewards</> in the <Assistant_Property1>Companion Shop</>.\n<Assistant_Title2> Family Title: </>Joining a Family automatically grants a <Assistant_Property1>Family Title</>. The Chief can modify the Family name in Family Details. Name changes have a <Assistant_Red>30-day</> cooldown, and the Family title will be updated accordingly upon a successful change.\n<Assistant_Title2> Family Display Stand: </>As the Family level increases, exclusive scenes for the Family display stand will be unlocked. For specific rules, please check <Assistant_Property1>Family-Display Stand Rules</>.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family-Contract Methods]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family-Level Rules]|668}, {SendAnswer:[Family-Display Stand Rules]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [РЎРµРјСЊСЏ - РћРїРёСЃР°РЅРёРµ РЅР°РіСЂР°РґС‹] </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Р‘РѕРЅСѓСЃ СЃРµРјРµР№РЅС‹С… Р°С‚СЂРёР±СѓС‚РѕРІ: </> РћР±СЉРµРґРёРЅРёРІС€РёСЃСЊ СЃ РѕРїСЂРµРґРµР»РµРЅРЅС‹Рј РєРѕР»РёС‡РµСЃС‚РІРѕРј С‡Р»РµРЅРѕРІ РѕРґРЅРѕР№ СЃРµРјСЊРё РІ РїРѕРґР·РµРјРµР»СЊРµ, РІС‹ РјРѕР¶РµС‚